{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1054680-what-refinement-would-this-be","id":1054680,"title":"What Refinement would this be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-25T01:24:01-08:00","id":1054680,"title":"What Refinement would this be?","content":"Topic for advising on choosing Refinement for Created base on it's goals. My player's character have new goal to become martyr for being to change Boston mages Lex Magica to recognize other supernaturals ( vampires,werewolves, Created etc. ) as individuals under Lex, secured from being 'chained' to Mage groups. On first hearing this I thought about Cobalus as perfecting concept, but I'm not sure here...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T09:40:32-08:00","id":1054807,"title":"","content":"There is literal Martyr Role in Ferrum Refinement, but I'm not sure is it works with this 'ideological Martyr for cause' player want's to dwell in to. Still, player wanted to go for Ferrum in the first place, generally for character. On the other hand, Ferrum do not seem as Refinement about political fight. I don't know... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T11:08:07-08:00","id":1054870,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1054680-what-refinement-would-this-be?p=1054807#post1054807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is literal Martyr Role in Ferrum Refinement, but I'm not sure is it works with this 'ideological Martyr for cause' player want's to dwell in to. Still, player wanted to go for Ferrum in the first place, generally for character. On the other hand, Ferrum do not seem as Refinement about political fight. I don't know... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>While I generally get mad, especially in Promethean, at people wanting to do things for the powers as opposed to the actual story, I think the Martyr Role in Ferrum is perfect for a would-be political activist. It's someone who throws themselves out - generally in their body, since Ferrum is Refinement of Body - and takes suffering so that others don't have to. Nobody has to say that can't also be their reputation, and if they're doing a hunger strike or something like that, it does affect their body as well.<br /> <br /> I would say that the Martyr Role shouldn't actually count towards a Milestone unless they actually SUFFER the pain of being a political activist. Pepper spray in the eyes every other hour. Dogs being unleashed on them. Being hosed by powerful water pressure. Somebody trying to beat them up. Hell, if they're advocating AGAINST Mages, they could suffer a lot more than that. But it's about pain for the sake of others. Make it about pain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12981-romulusgloriosus","name":"RomulusGloriosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T12:05:56-08:00","id":1054901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RomulusGloriosus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1054680-what-refinement-would-this-be?p=1054870#post1054870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would say that the Martyr Role shouldn't actually count towards a Milestone unless they actually SUFFER the pain of being a political activist. Pepper spray in the eyes every other hour. Dogs being unleashed on them. Being hosed by powerful water pressure. Somebody trying to beat them up. Hell, if they're advocating AGAINST Mages, they could suffer a lot more than that. But it's about pain for the sake of others. Make it about pain.</div> </div> </div> </div>On last game session character almost earthquake the Atheneum with his Transmutations to make point. What could count up as Martyr Role Milestone then against mages? Being hit with Lethal damage by them? Getting Aggravated damage from spells? Or maybe surviving some weird Condition cast on Created?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-25-2017, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T13:25:02-08:00","id":1054922,"title":"","content":"The Martyr Role is about surviving what would kill a human, pushing a body to its limits and beyond. Push their endurance, really make them suffer. Crucify them, figuratively or literally, and have them come down off that cross enlightened. A good Refinement to follow up the character arc would be Phosphorum; burn twice as bright for half as long, be a beacon, a lash, a firebrand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-25T20:56:43-08:00","id":1055070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1054680-what-refinement-would-this-be?p=1054922#post1054922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A good Refinement to follow up the character arc would be Phosphorum; burn twice as bright for half as long, be a beacon, a lash, a firebrand.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean here to do Phosphorum AFTER Ferrum and Martyr Role?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-26T20:27:25-08:00","id":1055520,"title":"","content":"Yes, exactly","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}